      "card_ref": 10,
      "description": "Enter the 4-digit case reference number from the escalation email.\n\nFrom: company.secretary@firm.hk\nTo: transformation-team@firm.hk\nSubject: Urgent — Review Required: CR-2026-0312\n\nA connected transaction executed last week may not have followed the prescribed disclosure process. Please conduct an immediate review and confirm whether a Chapter 14A notification is required. HKEX filing window is active.",
